 navigation component with a position which can vary depending to the OS."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The tab bar can be found at the bottom of the screen for iOS. It can vary for iPadOS.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"It allows users to switch between the sections of an app.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Each tab can be represented by a label, optionally paired with an icon, and maintains persistent visibility across top-level destinations.","type":"text"}]}}}